    "slug": "index",
    "title": "User Manual",
    "html": "<p>A plain-language guide to running your event's call for speakers, reviewing submissions, building the agenda, and keeping speakers on track. This is the manual for the people actually using the app day to day — organisers, reviewers, and speakers — not a technical spec.</p>\n<blockquote><p>Looking for the technical specification instead? See ../README.md.</p></blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"how-this-manual-is-organised\">How this manual is organised</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>Workflow guides</strong> — narrative walkthroughs of a task from start to finish, for when you want to know <em>how to get something done</em>.</li><li><strong>Screen reference</strong> — one page per item in the admin sidebar, describing every non-obvious control on that screen. For when you want to know <em>what a particular screen does</em>.</li><li><strong>Lifecycle guides</strong> — how one record (a contact, a submission, or the event itself) moves through the whole app over time, cutting across several screens.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"workflow-guides\">Workflow guides</h2>\n<div class=\"manual-table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Guide</th><th>Covers</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=getting-started\">Getting started</a></td><td>Signing in, events, roles, finding your way around</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=call-for-speakers\">Building your call for speakers</a></td><td>Form builder, conditional questions, publishing</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=reviewing-submissions\">Reviewing and deciding on submissions</a></td><td>The submissions list, scoring, accept/decline</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=emails-and-reminders\">Emails, reminders and calendar invites</a></td><td>Templates, automatic reminders, calendar invites</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=speaker-portal\">The speaker portal</a></td><td>What speakers see and do after acceptance</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"screen-reference-left-hand-admin-sidebar\">Screen reference (left-hand admin sidebar)</h2>\n<div class=\"manual-table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Screen</th><th>Covers</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=dashboard\">Dashboard</a></td><td>Today, Speaker Tracking, Submissions Pipeline, and the all-events board</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=workspace\">Workspace</a></td><td>Shared tab mechanics and the global anchor filter</td></tr><tr><td>↳ <a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=workspace-speakers\">Speakers</a></td><td>The Speakers tab</td></tr><tr><td>↳ <a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=workspace-submissions\">Submissions</a></td><td>The Submissions tab</td></tr><tr><td>↳ <a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=workspace-tasks\">Tasks</a></td><td>The Tasks tab</td></tr><tr><td>↳ <a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=workspace-reviews\">Reviews</a></td><td>The Reviews tab</td></tr><tr><td>↳ <a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=workspace-comments\">Comments</a></td><td>The Comments tab</td></tr><tr><td>↳ <a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=workspace-messages\">Messages</a></td><td>The Messages tab</td></tr><tr><td>↳ <a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=workspace-files\">Files</a></td><td>The Files tab</td></tr><tr><td>↳ <a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=workspace-events\">Events</a></td><td>The Events tab, and creating/switching events</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=forms\">Forms</a></td><td>The call-for-speakers form list and builder</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=evaluation\">Evaluation</a></td><td>Setting up review rounds and reviewers</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=review\">Review</a></td><td>The reviewer's own scoring workspace</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=agenda\">Agenda</a></td><td>Drag-and-drop scheduling and conflict resolution</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=greenroom\">Green Room</a></td><td>The day-of run-of-show screen</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=pipeline\">Pipeline</a></td><td>The org-wide speaker/sponsor prospecting board</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=embeds\">Embeds</a></td><td>Generating embeddable widgets and feeds</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=settings\">Settings</a></td><td>Every settings card: tokens, rooms/tracks, fields, statuses, templates, chase mode</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"lifecycle-guides\">Lifecycle guides</h2>\n<div class=\"manual-table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Guide</th><th>Traces</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=contact-lifecycle\">Contact lifecycle</a></td><td>A person: prospect → attached to an event → speaker status → portal → tasks → arrival</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=submission-lifecycle\">Submission lifecycle</a></td><td>A proposal: draft → decision → scheduled → published</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=event-lifecycle\">Event lifecycle</a></td><td>An event: created → configured → open → live → wrapped up</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"who-does-what\">Who does what</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>Organiser</strong> — sets up the event, builds the form, reviews and decides, schedules the agenda, chases speakers for missing information. Has access to everything in this manual.</li><li><strong>Reviewer</strong> — invited to score a batch of submissions. Only sees the <a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=review\">Review</a> workspace with the submissions assigned to them.</li><li><strong>Speaker</strong> — submits a proposal, and if accepted, completes their profile and any tasks through the <a href=\"?v=help&amp;page=speaker-portal\">speaker portal</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"conventions-used-in-this-manual\">Conventions used in this manual</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>Bold</strong> marks a button, tab, or label you'll see on screen exactly as written.</li><li><code>Code font</code> marks a URL pattern or a piece of text you'd type or search for.</li><li>A note like this calls out something easy to miss:</li></ul>\n<blockquote><p><strong>Note:</strong> Notes like this one flag a gotcha or a default worth knowing about.</p></blockquote>",
